                <pb facs="0750" n="638" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg638"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.77/932: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to the Chargé in
                        Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Cole</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-07-12T19:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12, 1919,
                                7 p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>710. Department understands Provisional Government is urging the retention at
                    Archangel of two companies of American Engineers. If so, what are your
                    views.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Polk</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
